msgstr "Modely fitaovana"

#: gpstemplates.php
msgid "Choose the Device Template to base this Map Template type."
msgstr "Safidio ny Modely Fitaovana hiorinan'ity karazana Modely Sarintany ity."

#: gpstemplates.php
